6 packets stopped at an extension header before their ports are read - a client could send DNS or SYNs behind a Hop-by-Hop header past its session's limits, while the kernel reads through it","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"OliveTin/OliveTin","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-23T22:59:39Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"add4f1c545820dc7fb6a413ccb3ba664b1e4a045","github_link":"https://github.com/OliveTin/OliveTin/commit/add4f1c545820dc7fb6a413ccb3ba664b1e4a045","commit_subject":"fix: skip nil actions when rebuilding the action map","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"amd/gaia","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-23T22:59:39Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"c9a7140202f965e209fd42178d2cab863c090868","github_link":"https://github.com/amd/gaia/commit/c9a7140202f965e209fd42178d2cab863c090868","commit_subject":"fix(ui): name the connector and show the output on MCP tool steps (#5622)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"OliveTin/OliveTin","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-23T22:59:29Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"1f51da5a32e65c51355b2e93c1505c24836dc342","github_link":"https://github.com/OliveTin/OliveTin/commit/1f51da5a32e65c51355b2e93c1505c24836dc342","commit_subject":"fix: publish config decode failures to the live issue list","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"open-chat-labs/open-chat","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-23T22:59:28Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"d20fb3845310762c79a533f663387ff580450ffe","github_link":"https://github.com/open-chat-labs/open-chat/commit/d20fb3845310762c79a533f663387ff580450ffe","commit_subject":"New web UI: the CHIT dialog and the rail's CHIT button (8d, part 1) (#10213)","ai_tool":"Claude"}]